   - `rmw_fastrtps_shared_cpp::register_type_object` mandatory in Jazzy publisher path
   - Zero-copy intra-process / loaned messages / shared memory (explicitly disallowed in the original patch)
   - BehaviorTree.CPP v4 XML format (`BTCPP_format="4"`) vs Humble's v3.8
