   - `example/src/topics/latency_ros2msg_nested_talker.cpp` — uses `nav_msgs::msg::Odometry`, declares only `topic`/`total_msgs`/`period_ms`; **no history_len/blob_bytes** → benchmark shape mismatch confirmed
