   - `rclcpp/rclcpp/include/rclcpp/detail/protobuf_typesupport_fastrtps.hpp` (245 lines) — the core patch: builds `message_type_support_callbacks_t`, zero-copy via `cdr.getCurrentPosition()` / `cdr.jump(len)`, synthetic `MessageMember` (`ROS_TYPE_UINT8`, `is_array_=true`), `TypeSupportBundle{fastrtps, introspection_cpp}`, `top_level_ts` with a `func` that dispatches by identifier string
